                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I absolutely love this game, nothing better than coming home from a hard day at work and clearing your head out with a few puzzles. The art style and scenery is really relaxing and fun; but hidden underneath the soft exterior is a devilish hard and interesting game. \n\nTooki is super cute and there are so many Awww! Moments; followed directly by Gerrrr! moments. Accidently walking into a Chomper will make anyone jump out of their skin! And there are puzzles I’ve realised I’ve been holding my breath for entire time, my god what an intense game it can be. \n\nEach time you fail it’s by your own blind stupidly and a little animation plays of poor Tooki getting it! and   you can’t help but think I’m so sorry Tooki, hold on and I’ll get you to the next puzzle. \nI never been so hooked like this on any game before, this is a first for me and I love it",
